#: audio_describer/core/audio_describer.py:37
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Analyze this video segment. Identify every distinct character who appears. For each character, provide:\n"
"    1. A unique ID (e.g., \"man_in_red_shirt\", \"woman_with_glasses\"). Use underscores.\n"
"    2. A definitive physical description (e.g., \"A tall man with glasses and a grey suit.\").\n"
"    3. The character's name, if and only if it is spoken clearly in the segment and can be unambiguously linked to them. If the name is not spoken or the link is ambiguous, this field must be null.\n"
"    \n"
"    Return this as a single JSON object with a single key \"characters\" which contains a list of these character objects.\n"
"    Example: {\"characters\": [{\"id\": \"man_in_suit\", \"description\": \"A man in a dark suit.\", \"name\": \"David\"}]}\n"
"    "
msgstr ""

